        "original_id": "ea389a6f-7308-5616-9b15-ad0d27b2d795",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Magnolia, First Light of Dawn\n- People: Jeremy Blackman, Tom Cruise, Melinda Dillon, Philip Baker Hall, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Ricky Jay, William H. Macy, Alfred Molina, Julianne Moore, John C. Reilly, Jason Robards, Melora Walters, Paul Thomas Anderson\n- Events: 50th Berlin International Film Festival, World War II\n- Places: San Fernando Valley\n\nFacts:\n- Jason Robards was a United States Navy combat veteran of World War II.\n- Magnolia is a film starring Jeremy Blackman, Tom Cruise, Melinda Dillon, Philip Baker Hall, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Ricky Jay, William H. Macy, Alfred Molina, Julianne Moore, John C. Reilly, Jason Robards, and Melora Walters.\n- Magnolia depicts a mosaic of interrelated characters searching for happiness, forgiveness, and meaning in the San Fernando Valley.\n- At the 50th Berlin International Film Festival, the Golden Bear was awarded to the American film Magnolia, which was directed by Paul Thomas Anderson.\n- First Light of Dawn was entered into the main competition at the 50th Berlin International Film Festival.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
